      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6x7",
          "text": "What Is Negligence in a Premises Liability Case?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xa",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6x9",
          "text": "A premises liability case is a civil lawsuit brought on the assertion that the owner or controller of a piece of property failed to uphold a reasonable standard of property safety, care, and maintenance and that this is why an injury took place. Most premises liability cases are centered on the theory that the property owner was negligent and that without this negligence, the accident would not have happened. Negligence consists of four elements:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xb",
          "text": "Duty of Care",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xc",
          "text": ". All property owners in Colorado owe duties of care to those visiting their premises. These duties vary based on the classification of the visitor as an invitee, licensee or trespasser.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xe",
          "text": "Breach of Duty",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xf",
          "text": ". A breach of duty can refer to any failure by the property owner to correctly maintain safe premises, such as ignoring an uneven curb in the parking lot.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xh",
          "text": "Causation",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xi",
          "text": ". Causation is a connection between the property owner’s negligent property care or maintenance and the plaintiff’s injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xk",
          "text": "Damages",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xl",
          "text": ". Damages refer to the specific and compensable losses suffered by the plaintiff because of the slip and fall accident, such as medical costs, pain, and suffering, or lost wages.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l6xo",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/thornton-personal-injury-attorney/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xn",
          "text": "With clear and convincing evidence of these four elements, a plaintiff can recover financial compensation from a property owner during a premises liability case in Colorado. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xp",
          "text": "Thornton injury lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "l6xo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6xq",
          "text": " can help you preserve and present evidence that establishes these elements to improve your chances of recovering a monetary award.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6xt",
